nder Ho Hup Group was responsible for building this innovative project. Bukit Jalil Development Sdn Bhd was established for the unique purpose of providing impetus to develop the entire Bandar Bukit Jalil.\n\n#### Aurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil Concept\n\nThe term “SOVO” means Smart Office, Versatile Office. Aurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil aims to cater for the needs of entrepreneurs, young urban professional as well as independent businesses and has created a space where they can work and enjoy a place for relaxation at the same time that compliments the modern lifestyle of young working adults of today. \nAurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil was completed in 2017 and the initial launch price was between RM416,300 – RM920,600. In conjunction with its launch, the developer put together a special “early bird” package that includes developer interest subsidy scheme, an interior design renovation package, waivers on the legal fees for sale and purchase agreements and loan agreement.\nOther prestigious projects developed by the developer include Apartment Sri Rakyat and Jalil Sutera. Also, other projects around the area that might be worth checking out include The Z Residence, Kiara Residence 2, The Rainz, Bukit Jalil, The COMO @ Bukit Jalil and Bukit OUG Condominiums.\n\n## Common facilities\n\nImage: security-access-control-o24-hour security  | Image: bbq-oBBQ\nImage: parking-oCovered car park  | Image: gym-oGym\nImage: shared-space-oMulti-purpose hall  | Image: parking-oParking\nImage: video-game-oRecreation Room  | Image: shop-oRetail stores\nImage: swim-oSwimming pool\n\n* * *\n\n* * *\n\n## Building details\n\nBuilding  | # Floors  | # Units\n--- | --- | ---\nBuilding @ Aurora Sovo Bukit Jalil  | 18  | 209\n\n## FAQs\n\n##### What are the selling prices in Aurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil?\n\nSelling prices in Aurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil start from RM 380,000.\n\n##### What is the PSF for Aurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil?\n\nThe current PSF range in Aurora Sovo @ Bukit Jalil start from RM 695.\n\n####